+// The luminance weights of the space the HDR target is actually in this frame. One place, because
+// two of them would eventually disagree: the per-view constant buffer publishes this to every
+// pixel shader in the chain (as a DELTA from Rec.709, see GeneratePerViewConstantBuffer), and the
